一部です。\n\nパーカー例、キャラクターの公式立ち絵等は下部リンクから確認をお願いします。\n\nパーカー例\nhttps://www.mono-mart.jp/item/77207032.html?srsltid=AfmBOopJsFOhQAHQUh7VvFxoXozgHiCXCOwRh6Bz9Btld1XP5eZ3up9D\n\n立ち絵全体図\nhttps://bluearchive.wikiru.jp/?plugin=attach&refer=%E3%83%AC%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B5&openfile=%E3%83%AC%E3%82%A4%E3%82%B5.png\n\nとても元気な子なのでそういう雰囲気で描いて頂けたらとても嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 720920, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "健やか", "screen_name": "100hituzi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1891656441003671552/fmL29lL7.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1273594963222130688/1772167355/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 745413, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "言葉@Skeb", "screen_name": "kotohatoko510", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2027397599914049536/a956QdlZ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/914444398414356480/1779018751/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 1407691, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "リクルティカの地下室", "screen_name": "Ricultica", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F92c938e1-762e-4101-80ef-a029a53eaf8f.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "http